[ti:Iltija Jor-Aazmaish]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Om Mani Padme Hum...
[00:14.96]Síocháin... síocháin...
[00:21.93]---
[00:28.89]Har taraf uzr hai, har su iltija ki bheed hai,
[00:35.86]Zindagi guzar rahi sabki jor-aazmaish mein.
[00:42.82]...jor-aazmaish mein... jor-aazmaish mein...
[00:49.79]Teri surat nahi dekhi hoti achha hota,
[00:56.75]Ab nahi neend teri achchi niyat ki khwahish mein.
[01:03.72]...khwahish mein... khwahish mein...
[01:10.68]---
[01:17.65]Naam bas ek rah gaya saans ki gunjaish mein,
[01:24.61]Zindagi guzar rahi sabki jor-aazmaish mein.
[01:31.58]Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh...
[01:38.54]Om Ah Hum...
[01:45.51]Kuch khamoshi thi pehle rooh ke sukoon mein,
[01:52.47]Ab lagi rehti hai jaane kis paimaish mein.
[01:59.44]---
[02:06.40]Nikhal bahe jab kaghaz par dil ke kuch riste ghaav,
[02:13.37]To laga mohabbat ek jua hai, rooh lagi hai daav mein.
[02:20.33]...rooh lagi hai daav mein... rooh lagi hai daav mein...
[02:27.30]Tere mil ke bichhadne ke baad, ek bas aarzu hai sukoon ki,
[02:34.26]Baat mohabbat tak theek thi, par ab baat hai junoon ki.
[02:41.23]...junoon ki... junoon ki...
[02:48.19]Aaaaaaaaaa...
[02:55.16]---
[03:02.12]Na koi fariyaad, na cheekh, na siski...
[03:09.09]Sirf rooh ki khamoshi hai.
[03:16.05]Hindustani: Aaaaaa...
[03:23.02]Arabic: Ooooooo...
[03:29.98]Latin: Eeeeeee...
[03:36.95]Tibetan: Uuuuuuu...
[03:43.91]West African: Aaaaaa...
[03:50.88]Celtic: Iiiiiii...
[03:57.84]Toota dil so tootne de... achha hai... khatam behoshi hai.
[04:04.81]Mera saaya tak cheekhta tha... tere naam ki kaisi madhoshi hai?
[04:11.77]---
[04:18.74]Rooh ki khamoshi hai... sirf rooh ki khamoshi hai...
[04:25.70]La la la... la la la...
[04:32.67]Om.........................
[04:39.63]Allah... Allah... Allah...
[04:46.60]Khamoshi...
